raph","text":">\nひなが自撮りの邪魔をしてきたので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38492WNYR3VZQC9RF5J7CH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n仕返しました笑　髪の毛〜　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ384A2WS065978RD4MDXGFB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　ちぇりちぇり🍒可愛いです　　　　　　　それではこの辺で！　　　じゃあね( ᐛ )٩و　\n#326雑務　　　　　"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-31511":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドライヤーをすると歌いだしてしまう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46   二期生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮崎県出身   20歳の松田里奈です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかドライヤーで髪を乾かそうとドライヤーを始めた瞬間に歌いたくなってしまうんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共感してくれる方います?\\( ⍢ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもよく熱唱しすぎて髪乾かしてない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風が髪に当たってない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰ ⋱⋰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11/1に東京でのローソンイベントに参加させていただいていました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}